Third-party attribution
=======================

The two bundled LaTeX layouts in assets/templates/ are adaptations of existing
community resume templates. In both cases the visual settings (page geometry,
section rules, list spacing, font choice) come from the upstream work; the
\resume* command definitions are this project's own implementation of the
interface documented in references/INTERFACE.md.


