assets/templates/engineering.tex
--------------------------------

Adapted from the resume template maintained in the r/EngineeringResumes
community wiki.

  Upstream: https://www.reddit.com/r/EngineeringResumes/wiki/

The wiki does not state an explicit license. What is reused here is a small
set of LaTeX configuration values -- 0.5in margins, a bold section heading
followed by a rule, and itemize spacing -- rather than macro code. The command
definitions in this file were written for this project's interface.

If you need certainty about reuse terms, check the wiki page for current
statements before redistributing.
